  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerSpeed.0.25">4 times slower</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerSpeed.1">Real speed</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerSprite">The picked frame on the sprite. Click or drag to put the cross (the particle's anchor) there (CenterX / CenterY). Drag the right edge for width (ScaleX), the top edge for height (ScaleY). One drag is one undo step</s:String>
