  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerTile">Frame {0} (row {1}, column {2}); live viewport particles on it: {3}. Click to show it in the sprite view</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerTileU">Frames across (the material's TileU), 1–64</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerTileV">Frames down (the material's TileV), 1–64</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerToFile">Put the pivot and scale back to the file on disk</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.SlicerViewAlpha">Transparency only: white shows, black does not</s:String>
