  <s:String x:Key="Tip.Track.Light">Lights and haze by state: in a project, with Play states</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.Track.Screen">Screen tint and strikes: in a project, with Play states</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.Track.Sound">Sounds by state: in a project, with Play states</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.Track.Spin">Script turn and path of the source: in a project, with Play states</s:String>
