  <s:String x:Key="Tip.Unknown">Key {0} is not in the game schema: kept and edited as it is</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="Tip.UpscaleModel">The model .param file (a .bin of the same name must sit beside it), for example realesrgan-x4plus.param</s:String>
